# Atlas Core - Component Design Tokens Specification
**Author:** Pixel Hale  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D11 06:00  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Optimized, lightweight component token dictionary for Atlas Core. Engineered under a cost-cutter approach to eliminate token bloat, maximize reuse across SaaS and F2F interfaces, and strictly align with the Company Document guidelines.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Pixel Hale (Design Agent)",
    "version": "1.0.0-lean",
    "reference": "Company Document - applied to constrain color palette steps, standardize typography scales, and consolidate SaaS vs Face-to-Face UI variables into a single shared token bundle to reduce runtime memory and maintenance overhead."
  },
  "color": {
    "brand": {
      "primary": { "value": "#0B4F6C", "type": "color" },
      "accent": { "value": "#01BAEF", "type": "color" },
      "surface": { "value": "#FBFBFF", "type": "color" },
      "text": { "value": "#040F16", "type": "color" }
    },
    "feedback": {
      "success": { "value": "#2B9348", "type": "color" },
      "warning": { "value": "#E85D04", "type": "color" },
      "error": { "value": "#D00000", "type": "color" }
    }
  },
  "spacing": {
    "base": { "value": "4px", "type": "dimension" },
    "sm": { "value": "{spacing.base} * 2", "type": "dimension" },
    "md": { "value": "{spacing.base} * 4", "type": "dimension" },
    "lg": { "value": "{spacing.base} * 6", "type": "dimension" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "fontFamily": {
      "sans": { "value": "Inter, system-ui, sans-serif", "type": "fontFamily" }
    },
    "scale": {
      "body": { "value": "14px", "type": "dimension" },
      "heading": { "value": "18px", "type": "dimension" }
    }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "padding-y": { "value": "{spacing.sm}" },
      "padding-x": { "value": "{spacing.md}" },
      "bg-primary": { "value": "{color.brand.primary}" },
      "radius": { "value": "4px" }
    },
    "card": {
      "bg": { "value": "{color.brand.surface}" },
      "padding": { "value": "{spacing.md}" },
      "border": { "value": "1px solid rgba(4,15,22,0.1)" }
    }
  }
}
```